    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just something people say to be nice. it doesn't change the reality. my whole identity was built on what my body could execute. without that, the \"me\" that matters is gone. i'm just stuck inhabiting this wreckage that doesn't do anything anymore. it feels like being a passenger in a corpse.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
